owledge is taught and answers are small.\nMy peers are discussing the latest theory,\nWhile I’m stuck in this lazy, lethargic era.\nThe professor’s voice, I imagine, drones on,\nWhile I scroll through feeds until the break is gone.\n\nSECTION 3\nThe guilt creeps in like a cold, damp fog,\nIgnoring the logic, ignoring the dog\nThat barks at the door, demanding a walk,\nWhile I ignore every single chalk\nThat snaps on the board in a classroom far away,\nWasting the hours of the academic day.\n\nSECTION 4\nThe deadline looms like a stormy sky,\nWith no good excuse, no valid \"why.\"\nI stare at the bill, the tuition paid,\nFor a education that I have betrayed.\nThe system is broken, the logic is cracked,\nAnd there is no way to turn the clock back.\nCan I get my money back for the classes I missed?", "seconds": 21.42, "fast": false, "mem": {"start": 26.713, "end": 26.762, "max": 27.401, "life": 27.595, "paused_s": 0.0, "frozen_s": 0.0}, "ref2": {"n": 284, "calls": {"qmm16c": 51223, "mlx16": 84900, "linear": 566, "hc_read": 27168, "hc_eager16": 283, "attention": 3396, "experts": 0, "slot_calls": 0, "sdpa_split": 180, "kb_pad": 0, "tier_calls": 0, "gdnx": 10188, "nax4": 0, "att_single": 0, "gdn_inproj": 0, "att_rope": 0, "idx_prep": 0, "hc_write": 0, "gdn_inproj_x": 0, "nax6": 13584, "nax6_ooo": 0, "gdnb": 0, "hc_b": 0, "nax_hybrid": 0, "nax_native": 13584, "nax_repack": 0, "native_3c": 0, "fatt_verify": 0, "verify_old": 3408, "verify_old_eligible": 3396, "fatt_r8": 0, "dense_native": 0, "dense_native_repack": 0, "hc8_fast": 0, "dense_native_unpack": 0}}}
